The demand of ornamental fishes is increasing remarkably due to their important role  in  the  world  trade  for  fish  and  fishery  production.  About  288  exotic  varieties  of ornamental fishes are popular in West Bengal.  Singapore is considered to be a major supplier  of  ornamental  fishes  in  the  international  market.  Singapore  exports  about US$80 million of ornamental fishes annual